---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/communities.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="DuPage County Communities | AJ Tayfel"
  description="Explore communities throughout DuPage County and Chicago's western suburbs with AJ Tayfel, REALTOR®."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Local Communities</p>

      <h1>
        Find the place that<br />
        fits the way you live.
      </h1>

      <p class="lede">
        A community is more than a ZIP code. Housing stock, taxes, access,
        amenities, transportation, and neighborhood character can change
        significantly from one suburb to another.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="intro">
    <div class="container intro-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Western Suburbs</p>
        <h2>Compare communities with context.</h2>
      </div>

      <p>
        The right location depends on what matters to you. These are several
        communities I serve throughout DuPage County and the surrounding
        western suburbs.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="community-section">
    <div class="container community-list">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <div><h2>Naperville</h2><p>A large and varied suburban market with multiple housing styles, established neighborhoods, newer development, and extensive amenities.</p></div>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <div><h2>Wheaton</h2><p>An established DuPage County community with a traditional downtown, varied housing stock, and convenient access across the western suburbs.</p></div>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <div><h2>Downers Grove</h2><p>A western-suburban market with mature neighborhoods, commuter access, a walkable downtown area, and a broad range of home types.</p></div>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>04</span>
        <div><h2>Glen Ellyn</h2><p>An established community with distinctive neighborhoods, older housing stock, local amenities, and access to the broader DuPage County market.</p></div>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>05</span>
        <div><h2>Lisle</h2><p>A centrally located DuPage community with condominium, townhome, and single-family options plus strong regional access.</p></div>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>06</span>
        <div><h2>Beyond DuPage</h2><p>Considering another western suburb? We can compare the local market, housing options, commute, and transaction considerations that matter for your move.</p></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing">
    <div class="container closing-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Not Sure Where to Focus?</p>
        <h2>Tell me what matters most in your next community.</h2>
      </div>

      <a class="button-premium" href="/contact/">
        Start a Conversation
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
